{
  "id": 8867178381511,
  "title": "Personalized Baseball Bedding Full Size Flag Custom Name Duvet Cover",
  "handle": "personalized-baseball-bedding-full-size-flag-custom-name-duvet-cover",
  "body_html": "<p>Embrace your love for baseball with this personalized bedding set from Jeminise. This comforter set combines comfort with a passion for the game, making it an ideal gift for baseball players and fans alike. Customize it to make it uniquely yours or a thoughtful present.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Features custom name options to create a unique and special bedding set.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> Perfect for baseball players, fans, and lovers, suitable for various occasions like Valentine's, Mother's, Father's Day, and Christmas.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Made from 100% brushed polyester fabric with microfiber filling for a soft, comfy, durable, and lightweight experience.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in US Twin, US Full, US Queen, and US King sizes to fit different beds.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water, can be air dried without heat for quick drying and fluffiness.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Manufacturing:</strong> Environmental protection techniques are used in the finishing process to prevent fading, with smooth, fine, and compact stitching.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> This set includes a duvet cover, with pillowcases also available.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester, Cotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Microfiber Filling</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Baseball Thunder</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Baseball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Baseball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Duvet Cover</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), US King (104\" x 88\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Breathable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>400</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
